# Catalog verification

- Persist skip/fail reasons on `last_error`; use `catalog report` and `/catalog/outcomes` for review.
- Full extract runs must write run logs under `catalog_state_dir/runs/` (manifest + batch JSONL).
- Document operator commands in [docs/CATALOG_VERIFICATION.md](docs/CATALOG_VERIFICATION.md).
- **Retry**: `--retry-failed` requeues `failed` only; skipped `no_definitions_or_phonetics` is usually intentional.
